  "duration_s": 132.77,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "今天谁学声狗叫，我直接给一千。领导，您看旺字就是狗叫的谐音，我祝您家庭旺，事业旺，财运旺，身体旺，这四声旺，你得给四千吧，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不，今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊。这一高兴就多贪了几杯，和你这么漂亮的女孩，吃饭不用喝就已经醉了。领导，您真幽默，您还没沾酒，就让我沾光了，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。哎，我这肚子喝茶都能胖。领导，你那不叫胖，那叫宰相肚里能撑船，装的全是大事儿，你干活怎么比乌龟还慢？领导，俗话说，慢工出细活，我细致的对待每一个工作项目，不就避免了以后出现什么质量问题吗？小王啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路，走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？不喝就是看不起我领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病。你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您，偶确实是好偶，就是心眼儿太多了。领导哦，虽然心眼多，也是您的下酒菜啊，这个世界上真的没有人会讨厌那些会说话，会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里边，有一句话，我特别欣赏。他说，当对象给你发红包时，高情商回答，你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。当同事向你借钱，不想借时，你就回。大家都是同样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？当心仪的女生说我想你时，高情商回答，随便想，千万别跟我客气。目前不收费。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊。每家的书架上不应该有一套这样的书吗？就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你我觉得这书适合所有人。所以强烈推荐你看看这套书这本书，真的可以帮助到大家，建议大家买回去看一看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 1550,
      "text": "今天谁学声狗叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1650,
      "end_ms": 2730,
      "text": "我直接给一千。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3010,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3550,
      "end_ms": 5250,
      "text": "您看旺字就是狗叫的谐音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5330,
      "end_ms": 6350,
      "text": "我祝您家庭旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6350,
      "end_ms": 6830,
      "text": "事业旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00007",
      "start_ms": 6830,
      "end_ms": 7270,
      "text": "财运旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00008",
      "start_ms": 7270,
      "end_ms": 7830,
      "text": "身体旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00009",
      "start_ms": 7910,
      "end_ms": 8610,
      "text": "这四声旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00010",
      "start_ms": 8650,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "你得给四千吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00011",
      "start_ms": 9750,
      "end_ms": 11050,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00012",
      "start_ms": 11070,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00013",
      "start_ms": 11550,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00014",
      "start_ms": 12670,
      "end_ms": 13870,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00015",
      "start_ms": 14030,
      "end_ms": 14370,
      "text": "这不，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00016",
      "start_ms": 14370,
      "end_ms": 15530,
      "text": "今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00017",
      "start_ms": 15530,
      "end_ms": 16070,
      "text": "高兴啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00018",
      "start_ms": 16149,
      "end_ms": 17690,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00019",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 19090,
      "text": "和你这么漂亮的女孩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00020",
      "start_ms": 19090,
      "end_ms": 21230,
      "text": "吃饭不用喝就已经醉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00021",
      "start_ms": 21250,
      "end_ms": 21590,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00022",
      "start_ms": 21590,
      "end_ms": 22310,
      "text": "您真幽默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00023",
      "start_ms": 22430,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "您还没沾酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00024",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 24150,
      "text": "就让我沾光了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00025",
      "start_ms": 24230,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00026",
      "start_ms": 25670,
      "end_ms": 27630,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00027",
      "start_ms": 27630,
      "end_ms": 29875,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00028",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 30440,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00029",
      "start_ms": 30640,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "我这肚子喝茶都能胖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00030",
      "start_ms": 32440,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00031",
      "start_ms": 33060,
      "end_ms": 33940,
      "text": "你那不叫胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00032",
      "start_ms": 34280,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "那叫宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00033",
      "start_ms": 36220,
      "end_ms": 37420,
      "text": "装的全是大事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00034",
      "start_ms": 37460,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "你干活怎么比乌龟还慢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00035",
      "start_ms": 39220,
      "end_ms": 39560,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00036",
      "start_ms": 39780,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00037",
      "start_ms": 40360,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "慢工出细活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00038",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 43580,
      "text": "我细致的对待每一个工作项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00039",
      "start_ms": 43760,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "不就避免了以后出现什么质量问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00040",
      "start_ms": 46220,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00041",
      "start_ms": 46880,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00042",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 49500,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00043",
      "start_ms": 49520,
      "end_ms": 51360,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00044",
      "start_ms": 51680,
      "end_ms": 53920,
      "text": "走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00045",
      "start_ms": 54020,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00046",
      "start_ms": 56280,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00047",
      "start_ms": 57500,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "我是看不起病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00048",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00049",
      "start_ms": 60210,
      "end_ms": 61760,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00050",
      "start_ms": 61800,
      "end_ms": 64180,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00051",
      "start_ms": 64180,
      "end_ms": 64935,
      "text": "我先敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00052",
      "start_ms": 65250,
      "end_ms": 66430,
      "text": "偶确实是好偶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00053",
      "start_ms": 66590,
      "end_ms": 67990,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00054",
      "start_ms": 67990,
      "end_ms": 69090,
      "text": "领导哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00055",
      "start_ms": 69090,
      "end_ms": 70050,
      "text": "虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00056",
      "start_ms": 70350,
      "end_ms": 71790,
      "text": "也是您的下酒菜啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00057",
      "start_ms": 71930,
      "end_ms": 74650,
      "text": "这个世界上真的没有人会讨厌那些会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00058",
      "start_ms": 74650,
      "end_ms": 75530,
      "text": "会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00059",
      "start_ms": 75630,
      "end_ms": 76770,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00060",
      "start_ms": 76950,
      "end_ms": 77670,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00061",
      "start_ms": 77770,
      "end_ms": 78745,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00062",
      "start_ms": 79060,
      "end_ms": 83220,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00063",
      "start_ms": 83460,
      "end_ms": 85535,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00064",
      "start_ms": 85870,
      "end_ms": 86910,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00065",
      "start_ms": 86990,
      "end_ms": 88245,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00066",
      "start_ms": 88510,
      "end_ms": 90955,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00067",
      "start_ms": 91330,
      "end_ms": 92150,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00068",
      "start_ms": 92150,
      "end_ms": 92690,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00069",
      "start_ms": 92690,
      "end_ms": 93510,
      "text": "我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00070",
      "start_ms": 93650,
      "end_ms": 94050,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00071",
      "start_ms": 94210,
      "end_ms": 95590,
      "text": "当对象给你发红包时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00072",
      "start_ms": 95670,
      "end_ms": 96490,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00073",
      "start_ms": 96490,
      "end_ms": 98475,
      "text": "你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00074",
      "start_ms": 98830,
      "end_ms": 99750,
      "text": "当同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00075",
      "start_ms": 99750,
      "end_ms": 100450,
      "text": "不想借时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00076",
      "start_ms": 100450,
      "end_ms": 100910,
      "text": "你就回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00077",
      "start_ms": 101190,
      "end_ms": 102415,
      "text": "大家都是同样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00078",
      "start_ms": 102670,
      "end_ms": 103250,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00079",
      "start_ms": 103250,
      "end_ms": 103910,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00080",
      "start_ms": 104130,
      "end_ms": 106050,
      "text": "当心仪的女生说我想你时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00081",
      "start_ms": 106310,
      "end_ms": 107170,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00082",
      "start_ms": 107290,
      "end_ms": 107890,
      "text": "随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00083",
      "start_ms": 107990,
      "end_ms": 109070,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00084",
      "start_ms": 109130,
      "end_ms": 110025,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00085",
      "start_ms": 110470,
      "end_ms": 111590,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00086",
      "start_ms": 111590,
      "end_ms": 113890,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00087",
      "start_ms": 114010,
      "end_ms": 116325,
      "text": "每家的书架上不应该有一套这样的书吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00088",
      "start_ms": 116570,
      "end_ms": 119755,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00089",
      "start_ms": 120180,
      "end_ms": 122820,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00090",
      "start_ms": 122820,
      "end_ms": 123920,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00091",
      "start_ms": 124100,
      "end_ms": 127225,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你我觉得这书适合所有人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00092",
      "start_ms": 127510,
      "end_ms": 130040,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐你看看这套书这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00093",
      "start_ms": 130040,
      "end_ms": 131240,
      "text": "真的可以帮助到大家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c0f6d3cc3afed407_s00094",
      "start_ms": 131460,
      "end_ms": 132750,
      "text": "建议大家买回去看一看。"
    }
  ],
